    "project_purpose": "Citrea Bridge is a bridge for moving BTC and other supported tokens to and from Citrea. Its listed Ethereum contract surface includes LayerZero OFT-style adapter and proxy contracts for bridged assets such as WBTC and stablecoins where applicable, while generic deployment infrastructure should be treated separately from scoreable Citrea Bridge contracts.",
